<title>POLAND: PEKPOL FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 78,000.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 78,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.08 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.14 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.06 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Sales		   13.12 vs  14.71</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.20 vs   0.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.34 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.14 vs   0.16</p>
<p> Sales		   28.26 vs  29.73</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat procesor is Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
